# Readme for Search algorithms
Must to know search algorithms:
1. Linear search
2. Binary search


## Problems (easy to hard)

Work top to bottom. Each level adds one new idea on top of the last.

### Level 1 - Binary search basics
Idea: keep an invariant: the answer always lies in [low, high].

LeetCode 704.     Binary Search  - DONE
LeetCode 35.      Search Insert Position                          -- lower bound
LeetCode 278.     First Bad Version                               -- first True in F F F T T
LeetCode 69.      Sqrt(x)
LeetCode 744.     Find Smallest Letter Greater Than Target

### Level 2 - Boundaries and rotated arrays
LeetCode 34.      Find First and Last Position of Element in Sorted Array-- lower + upper bound
LeetCode 33.      Search in Rotated Sorted Array
LeetCode 81.      Search in Rotated Sorted Array II               -- duplicates break the half test
LeetCode 153.     Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array
LeetCode 162.     Find Peak Element                               -- binary search without a sorted array
LeetCode 540.     Single Element in a Sorted Array
LeetCode 74.      Search a 2D Matrix

### Level 3 - Binary search on the answer
Idea: if you can check 'is X feasible?' in O(n) and feasibility is monotonic, binary search X.

LeetCode 875.     Koko Eating Bananas
LeetCode 1011.    Capacity To Ship Packages Within D Days
LeetCode 410.     Split Array Largest Sum

### Level 4 - Hard
LeetCode 4.       Median of Two Sorted Arrays                     -- binary search on the partition
LeetCode 719.     Find K-th Smallest Pair Distance
